    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\nThis exceptional detached family home forms part of the Gort na Greine development in Ballinabrannagh village. It is located within meters of the local National School, Catholic Church, GAA Pitch and just a stone's throw from Milford Bridge. Local amenities include Clogrennane Woods (famous for bluebell walks), Oisin Park and the Barrow Track. Number 16 commands a large corner site overlooking the main green and supports multi off-street parking to its front. This block-built home has been extended to its rear with the addition of a cleverly designed family room, fully glazed on two sides to blend outdoor and indoor living, while snug and comfortable with a free-standing solid fuel stove. The entire now supports 126 sq m of quality accommodation over two floors. Generously proportioned bedrooms on the upper floor each enjoy built in wardrobes, while all three bathrooms are of a contemporary style and fully tiled. The residence supports every convenience and enjoys a bright, airy exterior, with beautiful colour schemes throughout. The exterior is equally well designed and attractive. An extensive lime stone slabbed patio links with each section of the large rear garden, while a modern Home Office Cabin supports 16msq of additional accommodation, suitable for a host of applications. Soft play areas, lawns, mature planting and even a tree house all blend to present a dream living space. Viewings of this property are highly recommended and are invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 3.20m x 3.08m\nComposite hall door and windows to front. Ceramic tiled floor. Carpeted stairs to upper floor. W.C. off. Alarm control panel. Coving.\n\nW.C. - 1.38m x 1.37m\nWindow to side. Ceramic tiled floor. Toilet and sink. Extractor fan.\n\nLounge - 4.12m x 3.97m\nFeature bay qindow to front. Blinds. Laminate timber flooring. Solid fuel fireplace with. Built in display and storage unit. P.V. cabinet. Coving. (External light fitting).\n\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 6.15m x 3.74m\nWindows to side and rear. Blinds. Recess lights. Ceramic tiled floor, part tiled walls. Fully fitted floor and wall units. Neff electric oven, ceramic hob, extractor fan, dishwasher. Double French doors to family room. Utility room off.\n\nUtility Room - 3.74m x 1.18m\nWindow to side. Blinds. Ceramic tiled floor. Extensive shelving and storage.\n\nFamily Room - 4.60m x 3.26m\nDouble doors to rear patio. Surround glazing, blinds. Feature corner solid fuel stove. Ceramic tiled floor. Vaulted, panelled ceiling. (External light fitting)\n\nLanding - 3.35m x 2.52m\nWindow to side, blinds, carpets. Hot press off. Attic access hatch with stira stairs to floored and shelved storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.37m x 2.32m\nFeature arched window to front. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Toilet, sink and bath with mixer taps. Wall, mirror and extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.00m x 3.87m\nMaster room, window to front. Curtains, pole and blinds. Carpets. Built in wardrobe. En-suite off.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.39m x 0.97m\nWindow to side. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Toilet, sink, shower cubicle. R90SR electric shower. Mirrored wall cabinet.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.06m x 3.77m\nDouble room, windows to rear. Roman blinds, carpets. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.36m x 2.36m\nSingle room, window to rear. Roman blinds, carpets. Built in wardrobe, shelving. (Ex. book shelves).\n\nGarden office/ chalet - 5.6m x 3.4m\nFully insulated and powered home office unit.\n\nOffice - 3.78m x 3.37m\nSliding patio doors to front decked exterior. Window to side. Smart electric wall heater. Laminate timber flooring. LED smart recess lighting\n\nStore - 3.37m x 1.82m\nGlass panelled door to front. Timber panelled floor and walls. Power and shelving.\n\nSteel shed - 3m x 3m\nSliding door to front. Concrete base. Power. Shelving.\n\n"
      },
